Conclusion

The EV Charging Network Planner provides an end-to-end solution for analyzing EV charging infrastructure and supporting strategic expansion planning. By integrating machine learning, SQL, geographic analysis, and business intelligence, the project enables infrastructure leaders to identify coverage gaps, forecast future demand, optimize investments, and improve the overall efficiency of the EV charging network.
